2026-07-27T08:29:10.4903199Z i /tmp/Rtmp9Xvyfz/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4903509Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4903875Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4904427Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4904917Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4905609Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:29:10.4906155Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
